---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
    title="Abhilash Honnavalli Puttaiah — Security Product Engineer"
    description="Security Product Engineer at Akamai. Building next-gen bot detection platforms. 10+ years across engineering, architecture, and fraud prevention."
>
    <nav>
        <span class="nav-brand">iamabhilash.in</span>
        <div class="nav-links">
            <a href="/tools">Tools</a>
            <a href="https://github.com/abilashhp" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>
            <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/abilashhp" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <main>
        <section class="hero">
            <h1>Abhilash Honnavalli Puttaiah</h1>
            <p class="title">Security Product Engineer · Akamai Technologies</p>
            <p class="tagline">
                I build systems that decide — in milliseconds — whether a request to your website
                is a human or a bot. 10+ years at Akamai across engineering, architecture, and
                fraud prevention. Based in Bengaluru.
            </p>
            <div class="hero-actions">
                <a href="/resume.pdf" download class="btn btn-primary">↓ Download Resume</a>
                <a href="/tools" class="btn btn-secondary">View Tools →</a>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="section">
            <h2>About</h2>
            <div class="divider"></div>
            <p class="body-text">
                For the last 4 years I've been an engineer inside Akamai's Bot Manager — used by
                some of the world's largest banks, retailers, and media companies. One system I
                built is the <strong>Scraper Score</strong> detection engine, which flags evasive
                bots based on request-level signals before they ever touch your data.
            </p>
            <p class="body-text">
                Before that, 6 years as a Solutions Architect — so I understand both how the
                technology works <em>and</em> what a customer actually needs from it. That
                combination is rare in pure engineering roles.
            </p>
            <p class="body-text">
                Currently open to <strong>Security Architect</strong>, <strong>Security Product
                Engineer</strong>, and <strong>Technical Product Manager</strong> roles where the
                problem is hard and the stakes are real.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="section">
            <h2>Experience</h2>
            <div class="divider"></div>
            <div class="experience-list">

                <div class="experience-item">
                    <div class="company-block">
                        <span class="company-name">Akamai Technologies</span>
                        <span class="company-tenure">10 years 6 months</span>
                    </div>

                    <div class="role-block">
                        <div class="experience-header">
                            <div>
                                <span class="role">Senior Software Engineer II</span>
                                <span class="location"> · Bengaluru</span>
                            </div>
                            <span class="duration">Jun 2022 – Present</span>
                        </div>
                        <ul class="experience-bullets">
                            <li>Built the <strong>Scraper Score</strong> detection system for Akamai Content Protector — classifying evasive bots via request-level signals before data exfiltration, protecting clients generating billions in annual revenue.</li>
                            <li>Architected the edge security metadata layer powering real-time bot detection across <strong>200M+ daily requests</strong>, reducing detection-to-route latency by ~35%.</li>
                            <li>Designed a DNS load balancer for Bot Manager's backend fleet achieving <strong>99.99% uptime</strong>, eliminating single-point-of-failure risk for Fortune 500 fraud-prevention infrastructure.</li>
                            <li>Drove 100% on-time migration of <strong>21 enterprise customers</strong> to production beta with zero SLA breaches, reducing post-migration support volume by ~40%.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>

                    <div class="role-block">
                        <div class="experience-header">
                            <div>
                                <span class="role">Senior Solutions Architect</span>
                                <span class="location"> · Bengaluru</span>
                            </div>
                            <span class="duration">Jul 2020 – May 2022</span>
                        </div>
                        <ul class="experience-bullets">
                            <li>Implemented Akamai-as-Code frameworks for 10+ enterprise customers, embedding CDN configuration into CI/CD pipelines and cutting deployment turnaround by ~30%.</li>
                            <li>Served as SME across 3 internal product-scaling initiatives, delivering structured beta feedback that shaped feature prioritisation and accelerated product readiness.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>

                    <div class="role-block">
                        <div class="experience-header">
                            <div>
                                <span class="role">Solutions Architect II</span>
                                <span class="location"> · Bengaluru</span>
                            </div>
                            <span class="duration">Feb 2018 – Jun 2020</span>
                        </div>
                        <ul class="experience-bullets">
                            <li>Owned end-to-end technical integration for 20+ enterprise accounts on Akamai's Web Performance and Security platform — maintaining a <strong>zero failed go-live</strong> record.</li>
                            <li>Led pre-sales architecture engagements for 15+ APAC enterprise accounts, contributing directly to regional quota attainment.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>

                    <div class="role-block">
                        <div class="experience-header">
                            <div>
                                <span class="role">Solutions Architect</span>
                                <span class="location"> · Bengaluru</span>
                            </div>
                            <span class="duration">Jan 2016 – Jan 2018</span>
                        </div>
                        <ul class="experience-bullets">
                            <li>Managed onboarding and post-go-live support for 20+ enterprise accounts, building the cross-functional delivery skills that led to the SA II promotion in 2018.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="experience-item">
                    <div class="company-block">
                        <span class="company-name">BT (British Telecom)</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="role-block">
                        <div class="experience-header">
                            <div>
                                <span class="role">Consultant</span>
                                <span class="location"> · Belfast</span>
                            </div>
                            <span class="duration">May 2015 – Aug 2015</span>
                        </div>
                        <ul class="experience-bullets">
                            <li>Delivered <strong>£3M in infrastructure cost savings</strong> by migrating 500+ enterprise clients from legacy Sentry API gateway to the Vordel cloud platform — zero downtime in 4 months through meticulous cutover planning and continuous C-suite stakeholder engagement.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="experience-item">
                    <div class="company-block">
                        <span class="company-name">Tech Mahindra</span>
                        <span class="company-tenure">3 years 9 months</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="role-block">
                        <div class="experience-header">
                            <div>
                                <span class="role">Design & Development Engineer</span>
                                <span class="location"> · Bengaluru</span>
                            </div>
                            <span class="duration">Feb 2014 – Jan 2016</span>
                        </div>
                        <ul class="experience-bullets">
                            <li>Delivered end-to-end API gateway implementations across 3 industry verticals, owning full-cycle policy development, SSL/TLS security setup, and production support with zero post-deployment incidents.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                    <div class="role-block">
                        <div class="experience-header">
                            <div>
                                <span class="role">Software Engineer</span>
                                <span class="location"> · Bengaluru</span>
                            </div>
                            <span class="duration">May 2012 – Jan 2014</span>
                        </div>
                        <ul class="experience-bullets">
                            <li>Designed functional and non-functional test strategies for enterprise applications; applied Agile/SCRUM methodologies across the full software delivery lifecycle.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="section">
            <h2>Skills</h2>
            <div class="divider"></div>
            <div class="skills">
                <span class="skill">Bot Detection & Prevention</span>
                <span class="skill">Fraud Prevention Engineering</span>
                <span class="skill">DNS Architecture</span>
                <span class="skill">Edge Security (CDN)</span>
                <span class="skill">API Gateway</span>
                <span class="skill">SSL / TLS</span>
                <span class="skill">Cloud Migration</span>
                <span class="skill">Azure</span>
                <span class="skill">CI/CD</span>
                <span class="skill">Python</span>
                <span class="skill">Solutions Architecture</span>
                <span class="skill">Agile / SCRUM</span>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="section">
            <h2>Education</h2>
            <div class="divider"></div>
            <div class="experience-list">
                <div class="experience-item">
                    <div class="experience-header">
                        <div>
                            <span class="role">M.S. — Telecommunications & Software Engineering</span>
                            <span class="company"> · BITS Pilani</span>
                        </div>
                        <span class="duration">2013 – 2015</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="experience-item">
                    <div class="experience-header">
                        <div>
                            <span class="role">B.E. — Telecommunications Engineering</span>
                            <span class="company"> · Visvesvaraya Technological University</span>
                        </div>
                        <span class="duration">2007 – 2011</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="section">
            <h2>Certifications & Awards</h2>
            <div class="divider"></div>
            <div class="awards">
                <div class="award-item">
                    <span class="award-icon">🏆</span>
                    <div>
                        <span class="award-name">Akamai STG Thunder Clap Award</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="award-item">
                    <span class="award-icon">🥈</span>
                    <div>
                        <span class="award-name">Webex Bot Hackathon — Runner Up II (2025)</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="award-item">
                    <span class="award-icon">☁️</span>
                    <div>
                        <span class="award-name">Microsoft Certified: Azure Fundamentals</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="award-item">
                    <span class="award-icon">⭐</span>
                    <div>
                        <span class="award-name">Multiple Spot Awards — Akamai (FY16, FY18)</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <p>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Abhilash Honnavalli Puttaiah · <a href="mailto:abilashhp69@gmail.com">abilashhp69@gmail.com</a></p>
    </footer>
</Layout>

<style>
    nav {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        padding: 20px 40px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
        position: sticky;
        top: 0;
        background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.9);
        backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
        z-index: 10;
    }

    .nav-brand {
        font-weight: 700;
        font-size: 1rem;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), var(--accent-2));
        -webkit-background-clip: text;
        -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        background-clip: text;
    }

    .nav-links {
        display: flex;
        gap: 24px;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    .nav-links a {
        color: var(--muted);
        transition: color 0.2s;
    }

    .nav-links a:hover {
        color: var(--text);
        text-decoration: none;
    }

    main {
        max-width: 760px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 60px 24px;
    }

    .hero {
        margin-bottom: 64px;
    }

    .hero h1 {
        font-size: 2.5rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), var(--accent-2));
        -webkit-background-clip: text;
        -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        background-clip: text;
        line-height: 1.2;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .title {
        font-size: 1rem;
        color: var(--muted);
        margin-bottom: 16px;
        font-weight: 500;
    }

    .tagline {
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        color: var(--text);
        max-width: 600px;
        margin-bottom: 32px;
        line-height: 1.75;
    }

    .hero-actions {
        display: flex;
        gap: 12px;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .btn {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 6px;
        padding: 12px 24px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        transition: opacity 0.2s, transform 0.1s;
        cursor: pointer;
    }

    .btn:hover {
        opacity: 0.85;
        text-decoration: none;
        transform: translateY(-1px);
    }

    .btn-primary {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3b82f6, #8b5cf6);
        color: #fff;
    }

    .btn-secondary {
        background: var(--surface);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        color: var(--text);
    }

    .section {
        margin-bottom: 56px;
    }

    .section h2 {
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.1em;
        color: var(--muted);
        margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .divider {
        height: 1px;
        background: var(--border);
        margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .body-text {
        color: var(--text);
        line-height: 1.75;
        margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .body-text strong { color: var(--accent); font-weight: 600; }
    .body-text em { color: var(--accent-2); font-style: normal; }

    .experience-list {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 40px;
    }

    .experience-item {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 20px;
    }

    .company-block {
        display: flex;
        align-items: baseline;
        gap: 10px;
    }

    .company-name {
        font-size: 1rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: var(--text);
    }

    .company-tenure {
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        color: var(--muted);
    }

    .role-block {
        padding-left: 16px;
        border-left: 2px solid var(--border);
    }

    .experience-header {
        display: flex;
        align-items: baseline;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 16px;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .role {
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        color: var(--text);
    }

    .company {
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    .location {
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.85rem;
    }

    .duration {
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        color: var(--muted);
        white-space: nowrap;
        flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .experience-bullets {
        padding-left: 18px;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 7px;
    }

    .experience-bullets li {
        color: #cbd5e1;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        line-height: 1.65;
    }

    .experience-bullets strong {
        color: var(--accent);
        font-weight: 600;
    }

    .skills {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 8px;
    }

    .skill {
        background: var(--surface);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        color: var(--text);
        padding: 6px 14px;
        border-radius: 20px;
        font-size: 0.83rem;
        font-weight: 500;
    }

    .awards {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 12px;
    }

    .award-item {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
    }

    .award-icon {
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .award-name {
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        color: var(--text);
    }

    footer {
        text-align: center;
        padding: 32px 24px;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.875rem;
    }

    footer a { color: var(--muted); }
    footer a:hover { color: var(--text); }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
        nav { padding: 16px 20px; }
        .hero h1 { font-size: 1.85rem; }
        main { padding: 40px 20px; }
        .experience-header { flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; }
    }
</style>
